    "slug": "frame-boundary-stop",
    "kind": "positive",
    "purpose": "truthy 分支深层弹出同样受 execute_intent 帧标记拦截——不被跨越出当前帧。",
    "preparation": "stack: [frame(IE), m1, m2, self]\nentry: skip_n(n=3)",
    "assertion": "expect(stack.map(e=>e.id)).toEqual(['frame'])",
    "note": "verify 停驻位置由帧标记决定而非由 n 决定。",
