    "subfig": {
      "name": "dag-sequence.puml",
      "title": "DAG 三步调度时序",
      "body": "@startuml\ntitle Subfigure: #15 DAG 三步调度时序\n\nparticipant test as T\nparticipant executeSkipN as SK\ndatabase state.stack as ST\n\nT -> ST : push(thenBlock)\nT -> ST : push(skip)\nnote over ST : length=2（bottom → top）\n\nT -> SK : executeSkipN(skip, n=0)\nactivate SK\nSK -> ST : pop self\ndeactivate SK\n\nnote over ST : length=1 仅剩 thenBlock\n\nT -> SK : executeSkipN(thenBlock)\nnote right of T\n  下一轮循环到 thenBlock 入口\n  由相应 handler 处理\nend note\n\n@enduml\n"
    },
